      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early promoters gave a quarter of Eastland’s lots to the Texas and Pacific Railway, and the first train rolled through in 1880.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://texastimetravel.com/directory/eastland-tour/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1914 Eastland boasted two banks, telephone service, and a public library.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
