      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eastland%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Eastland sits 96 miles west‑southwest of Fort Worth and 55 miles east of Abilene, north of the county’s center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
